      "speaker_id": "S5",
      "speaker_label": "梁教授",
      "start_ms": 225000,
      "end_ms": 250000,
      "scenario": "lecture",
      "text": "今天我们讲一致性哈希。这个叫 consistent hashing,原理是把节点和 key 都映射到同一个环上。定义为 virtual node 的概念,意思是用 vnode 解决数据倾斜问题。",
      "trigger_keywords": ["这个叫", "原理是", "定义为"],
      "expected_intent": "explain_concept",
      "expected_assist": "runWhatShouldISay"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "S5",
      "speaker_label": "梁教授",
      "start_ms": 250000,
      "end_ms": 265000,
      "scenario": "lecture",
      "text": "接下来,公式推导一下。假设环长 1,有 k 个节点、n 个 key,期望每个节点承载 key 的数量是 n/k,方差大约 1/k,标准差 1/sqrt(k)。",
      "trigger_keywords": ["公式", "推导", "期望"],
      "expected_intent": "render_formula",
      "expected_assist": "runWhatShouldISay"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "S5",
      "speaker_label": "梁教授",
      "start_ms": 265000,
      "end_ms": 275000,
      "scenario": "lecture",
      "text": "当一个节点加入或离开时,只有 1/k 比例的 key 会被重新映射,这就是相比 mod 哈希的最大优势。",
      "expected_intent": null,
      "expected_assist": null
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "S5",
      "speaker_label": "梁教授",
      "start_ms": 275000,
      "end_ms": 285000,
      "scenario": "lecture",
      "text": "谁知道为什么用 160 位的 vnode 而不是 32 位?有同学能答吗?",
      "trigger_keywords": ["谁知道", "为什么"],
      "expected_intent": "answer_class_question",
      "expected_assist": "runManualAnswer"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "S1",
